#: behaviour.cpp:46
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Behavior</h1> You can configure how Konqueror behaves as a file "
"manager here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Gedrag</h1> Jy kan Konqueror se gedrag as 'n lêer bestuurder hier "
"konfigureer."

#: behaviour.cpp:50
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "Verskillende Opsies"

#: behaviour.cpp:66
msgid "Open folders in separate &windows"
msgstr "Open gidse in aparte vensters"

#: behaviour.cpp:67
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Konqueror will open a new window when you open a "
"folder, rather than showing that folders's contents in the current window."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie gekies is, sal Konqueror 'n nuwe vesnter oopmaak wanneer "
"jy 'n vouer oopmaak, eerder as om dit in die bestaande venster oop te maak."

#: behaviour.cpp:74
msgid "&Show network operations in a single window"
msgstr "Vertoon netwerk operasies in 'n enkel venster"

#: behaviour.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Checking this option will group the progress information for all network file "
"transfers into a single window with a list. When the option is not checked, all "
"transfers appear in a separate window."
msgstr ""
"Deur hierdie opsie te merk, sal die vordering informasie van alle netwerk lêer "
"oordragte binnein 'n enkel venster met 'n lys gegroepeer word. Wanneer die opsie nie "
"gekies is nie, sal alle oordragte in aparte vensters verskyn."

#: behaviour.cpp:85
msgid "Show file &tips"
msgstr "Vertoon lêer leidrade"

#: behaviour.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Here you can control if, when moving the mouse over a file, you want to see a "
"small popup window with additional information about that file"
msgstr ""
"Hier kan jy beheer dat, wanneer die muis bo-oor 'n lêer beweeg, jy 'n klein opspring "
"venster sien met adisionele inligting aangaande die lêer"

#: behaviour.cpp:108
msgid "Show &previews in file tips"
msgstr "Vertoon voorskoue in lêer leidrade"

#: behaviour.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Here you can control if you want the popup window to contain a larger preview "
"for the file, when moving the mouse over it."
msgstr ""
"Hier kan jy beheer dat die opspring venster 'n groter voorskou van die lêer bevat, "
"wanneer die muis bo-oor dit beweeg."

#: behaviour.cpp:114
msgid "Rename icons in&line"
msgstr "Herbenoem ikone inlyns"

#: behaviour.cpp:115
msgid ""
"Checking this option will allow files to be renamed by clicking directly on the "
"icon name. "
msgstr ""
"Deur hierdie opsie te kies sal jy toelaat dat lêers herbenoem kan word deur direk op "
"ikoon se naam te kliek. "

#: behaviour.cpp:121
msgid "Home &URL:"
msgstr "Tuis URL:"

#: behaviour.cpp:126
msgid "Select Home Folder"
msgstr "Kies Tuis Vouer"

#: behaviour.cpp:131
msgid ""
"This is the URL (e.g. a folder or a web page) where Konqueror will jump to when "
"the \"Home\" button is pressed. This is usually your home folder, symbolized by "
"a 'tilde' (~)."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die URL (Bv. 'n vouer of 'n web-bladsy) waarheen Komqueror sal spring wanneer "
"die \"Tuis\" knoppie gedruk word. Hierdie is gewoonlik jou tuis vouer, vertoon deur "
"'n 'tilde' (~)."

#: behaviour.cpp:139
msgid "Show 'Delete' context me&nu entries which bypass the trashcan"
msgstr "Vertoon 'Skrap' konteks kiesbalkitems wat die Gemors gids sy-stap"

#: behaviour.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Check this if you want 'Delete' menu commands to be displayed on the desktop "
"and in the file manager's context menus. You can always delete files by holding "
"the Shift key while calling 'Move to Trash'."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie om die 'Uitvee'konteks kiesbalkitems te vertoon in die werkskerm  "
"en in die lêer bestuurder se konteks kiesbalke. Jy kan ook lêers uitvee deur die "
"Verskuiwende sleutel te druk saam met die 'Beweeg na Gemors' opsie."

#: behaviour.cpp:148
msgid "Ask Confirmation For"
msgstr "Vra Bevestiging Vir"

#: behaviour.cpp:150
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"\"delete\" a file. "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Move To Trash:</em> moves the file to your trash folder, from where it "
"can be recovered very easily.</li> "
"<li><em>Delete:</em> simply deletes the file.</li> </li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie sê vir Konqueror of dit vir 'n bevestiging moet vra wanneer jy "
" 'n lêer \"uitvee\". "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Beweeg na Gemors:</em> skuiwe die lêer na jou Gemors gids, van waar dit "
"maklik herwin kan word.</li> "
"<li><em>Uitvee:</em> vee eenvoudig die lêer uit.</li> "
"<li><em>Versnipper:</em> vee nie net die lêer uit nie, maar oorskryf die area op "
"die disket waar die lêer gestoor is, en maak sodoende herwinning onmoontlik. Jy moet nie die "
"bevestiging vir hierdie metode verwyder nie, tensy jy op gereelde basis met "
"uiters vertroulike inligting werk.</li></ul>"

#: behaviour.cpp:159
msgid "&Move to trash"
msgstr "Beweeg na gemors"

#: behaviour.cpp:161
msgid "D&elete"
msgstr "Uitvee"

#: browser.cpp:51
msgid "&Appearance"
msgstr "Voorkoms"

#: browser.cpp:52
msgid "&Behavior"
msgstr "Gedrag"

#: browser.cpp:53
msgid "&Previews && Meta-Data"
msgstr "Vorige && Meta-Data"

#: browser.cpp:57
msgid "&Quick Copy && Move"
msgstr "Vinnige Kopie && Skuif"

#: desktop.cpp:58
msgid ""
"<h1>Multiple Desktops</h1>In this module, you can configure how many virtual "
"desktops you want and how these should be labeled."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Veelvuldige Werkskerms</h1>In hierdie module, kan jy konfigureer hoeveel "
"virtuele werkskerms jy wil hê en hoe hierdie skerms ge-etiketeer moet wees."

#: desktop.cpp:71
msgid "N&umber of desktops: "
msgstr "Aantal werkskerms: "

#: desktop.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Here you can set how many virtual desktops you want on your KDE desktop. Move "
"the slider to change the value."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan die hoeveelheid virtuele werkskerms wat jy op jou KDE werkskerm wil hê stel. "
"Beweeg die skuiwer om die waarde te verander."

#: desktop.cpp:88
msgid "Desktop &Names"
msgstr "Werkskerm Name"

#: desktop.cpp:94 desktop.cpp:96
msgid "Desktop %1:"
msgstr "Werkskerm %1:"

#: desktop.cpp:98 desktop.cpp:99 desktop.cpp:100 desktop.cpp:101
#, c-format
msgid "Here you can enter the name for desktop %1"
msgstr "Hier kan jy die naam vir werkskerm %1 invoer"

#: desktop.cpp:114
msgid "Mouse wheel over desktop background switches desktop"
msgstr "Muis wiel oor werskerm agtergrond wissel die werkskerms"

#: desktop.cpp:224 desktop.cpp:242
#, c-format
msgid "Desktop %1"
msgstr "Werkskerm %1"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:73
msgid "Sound Files"
msgstr "Klank Lêers"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:133
msgid "&Left button:"
msgstr "Links knoppie:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:134
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the left button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies wat sal gebeur wanneer jy die links knoppie van jou aanwys "
"toestel op die werkskerm kliek:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:137
msgid "Right b&utton:"
msgstr "Regter knoppie:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:138
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the right button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies wat sal gebeur wanneer jy die regter knoppie van jou aanwys "
"toestel op die werkskerm kliek:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:154 desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:200
msgid ""
" "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that desktop, "
"or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching desktops if "
"necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or minimized "
"windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among other "
"things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the screen, "
"and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful for "
"quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known as "
"\"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
" "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Geen aksie:</em> soos jy mog dink, gebeur niks!</li> "
"<li><em>Venster lys kieslys:</em> 'n kieslys waar alle vensters op alle virtuele werkskerms "
"vertoon word spring op. Jy kan kliek op die werkskerm naam, of op 'n venster naam om die "
"fokus na daardie venster te skuif, of om, indien nodig werkskerms te wissel, en "
"die Venster te herstel as dit is weg gesteek is. Weg gesteekte of geminimaliseerde vensters "
"word verteenwoordig deur hulle name in aanhalingstekens te wys.</li> "
"<li><em>Werkskerm kieslys:</em> 'n konteks kieslys vir die werkskerm spring op. Hierdie "
" kieslys het onder andere opsies vir die konfigurering van die werkskerm vertoon, die "
"sluit van die skerm, en om af te teken uit KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Applikasie kieslys:</em> die \"K\" kieslys spring op. Hierdie is bruikbaar om "
"vinnig toegang te verkry tot programme indien jy daarvan hou om die paneel (ook bekend as "
"\"Kicker\") weg gesteek te hou van besigtiging.</li></ul>"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:175
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the middle button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that desktop, "
"or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching desktops if "
"necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or minimized "
"windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among other "
"things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the screen, "
"and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful for "
"quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known as "
"\"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies wat gebeur wanneer jy met die middelste knoppie van jou aanwys "
"toestel op die werkskerm kliek: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Geen aksie:</em> soos jy mog dink, gebeur niks!</li> "
"<li><em>Venster lys kieslys:</em> 'n kieslys waar alle vensters op alle virtuele werkskerms "
"vertoon word spring op. Jy kan kliek op die werkskerm naam, of op 'n venster naam om die "
"fokus na daardie venster te skuif, of om, indien nodig werkskerms te wissel, en "
"die Venster te herstel as dit is weg gesteek is. Weg gesteekte of geminimaliseerde vensters "
"word verteenwoordig deur hulle name in aanhalingstekens te wys.</li> "
"<li><em>Werkskerm kieslys:</em> 'n konteks kieslys vir die werkskerm spring op. Hierdie "
"kieslys het onder andere opsies vir die konfigurering van die werkskerm vertoon, die "
"sluit van die skerm, en om af te teken uit KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Applikasie kieslys:</em> die \"K\" kieslys spring op. Hierdie is bruikbaar om "
"vinnig toegang te verkry tot programme indien jy daarvan hou om die paneel (ook bekend as "
"\"Kicker\") weg gesteek te hou van besigtiging.</li></ul>"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:266
msgid "No Action"
msgstr "Geen Aksie"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:267
