#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:466
msgid ""
"<h1>Behavior</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose various options\n"
"for your desktop, including the way in which icons are arranged and\n"
"the pop-up menus associated with clicks of the middle and right mouse\n"
"buttons on the desktop.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Werkskerm</h1>\n"
"Hierdie module laat jou toe om verskeie opsies vir jou werkskerm\n"
"te kies, insluitend die wyse waarop ikone gerangskik word en\n"
"die spring-op kieslyste geassosieer met klieke van die middelste en regterkantste "
"muis knoppies op die Werkskerm.\n"
"Gebruik die \"Wat is Hierdie?\" (Verskuiwende+F1) om hulp te kry vir spesifieke "
"opsies."

#: fontopts.cpp:60
msgid "&Standard font:"
msgstr "Standaard skrif tipe:"

#: fontopts.cpp:64
msgid "This is the font used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Hierdie is die skrif tipe wat gebruik word om teks in Konqueror vensters te vertoon."

#: fontopts.cpp:79
msgid "Font si&ze:"
msgstr "Skrif tipe grootte:"

#: fontopts.cpp:87
msgid "This is the font size used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Hierdie is die skrif tipe grootte wat gebruik word om teks in Konqueror vensters te vertoon."

#: fontopts.cpp:95
msgid "Normal te&xt color:"
msgstr "Normale teks kleur:"

#: fontopts.cpp:99
msgid "This is the color used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Hierdie is die kleur wat gebruik word om teks in Konqueror vensters te vertoon."

#: fontopts.cpp:126
msgid "&Text background color:"
msgstr "Teks agtergrond kleur:"

#: fontopts.cpp:134
msgid "This is the color used behind the text for the icons on the desktop."
msgstr "Hierdie is die kleur wat gebruik word in die agtergrond van die teks van die ikone op "
"die werkskerm."

#: fontopts.cpp:146
msgid " lines"
msgstr "lyne"

#: fontopts.cpp:147
msgid "1 line"
msgstr "1 lyn"

#: fontopts.cpp:148
msgid "H&eight for icon text:"
msgstr "Hoogte van ikoon teks"

#: fontopts.cpp:154
msgid ""
"This is the maximum number of lines that can be used to draw icon text. Long "
"file names are truncated at the end of the last line."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die maksimum aantal lyne wat gebruik kan word om ikoon teks te trek. Lang "
"lêer name word afgesny aan die einde van die laste lyn."

#: fontopts.cpp:164
msgid " pixels"
msgstr "beeldelemente"

#: fontopts.cpp:166
msgid "&Width for icon text:"
msgstr "Wydte van ikoon teks"

#: fontopts.cpp:172
msgid ""
"This is the maximum width for the icon text when konqueror is used in multi "
"column view mode."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die masksimum wydte vir die vertoon van ikoon teks, wanneer konqueror "
"in meer-kolom vertoon wyse gebruik word."

#: fontopts.cpp:180
msgid "&Underline filenames"
msgstr "Onderstreep lêername"

#: fontopts.cpp:184
msgid ""
"Checking this option will result in filenames being underlined, so that they "
"look like links on a web page. Note: to complete the analogy, make sure that "
"single click activation is enabled in the mouse control module."
msgstr ""
"Deur hierdie opsie te kies sal lêername onderstreep word, sodat hulle sal lyk "
"soos die skakels op 'n web bladsy. Nota: om die analogie te voltooi maak seker "
"dat enkel muiskliek aktivering aangeskakel is in die muis kontrole module."

#: fontopts.cpp:193
msgid "Display file sizes in b&ytes"
msgstr "Vertoon lêer grotes in grepe"

#: fontopts.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Checking this option will result in file sizes being displayed in bytes. "
"Otherwise file sizes are being displayed in kilobytes or megabytes if "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Deur hierdie opsie te kies sal lêer grotes vertoon word in grepe. "
"Andersins word lêer grotes vertoon in kilogrepe of megagrepe soos nodig."

#: fontopts.cpp:390
msgid ""
"<h1>Appearance</h1> You can configure how Konqueror looks as a file manager "
"here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Voorkoms</h1> Jy kan Konqueror se voorkoms as 'n lêer bestuurder hier "
"konfigureer."

#: previews.cpp:65
msgid ""
"<p>Allow previews, \"Folder Icons Reflect Contents\", and retrieval of "
"meta-data on protocols:</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Laat voorskoue toe, \"Kabinet Ikone Reflekteer Inhoud\", en terugroep van "
"meta-data op protokolle:</p>"

#: previews.cpp:68
msgid ""
"<h1>Preview Options</h1> Here you can modify the behavior of Konqueror when it "
"shows the files in a folder."
"<h2>The list of protocols:</h2> check the protocols over which previews should "
"be shown; uncheck those over which they should not. For instance, you might "
"want to show previews over SMB if the local network is fast enough, but you "
"might disable it for FTP if you often visit very slow FTP sites with large "
"images."
"<h2>Maximum File Size:</h2> select the maximum file size for which previews "
"should be generated. For instance, if set to 1 MB (the default), no preview "
"will be generated for files bigger than 1 MB, for speed reasons."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Voorskou Opsies</h1> Hier kan die gedrag van Konqueror bepaal wanneer "
"dit die lêers in 'n vouer vertoon."
"<h2>Die lys van protokolle:</h2> Kies die lys van protokolle waarvoor voorskoue "
"gedoen moet word; Ontkies daardie waaroor daar nie voorskou gedoen moet word nie. "
"Jy wil byvoorbeeld, 'n voorskou rakende SMB hê, indien die lokale netwerk vinnig genoeg is, "
"maar jy sal dit vir FTP wil afskakel indien jy gereeld baie stadige FTP tuistes, "
"met groot beelde besoek."
"<h2>Maksimum Lêer grootte:</h2> Kies die maksimum lêer grootte waarbinne voorskoue "
"vertoon moet word. Indien dit byvoorbeeld, gestel word op 1 mb (die verstek), sal geen "
"voorskou getoon word vir lêers groter as 1 mb nie, weens spoed redes."

#: previews.cpp:81
msgid "Select Protocols"
msgstr "Kies Protokolle"

#: previews.cpp:89
msgid "Local Protocols"
msgstr "Lokale Protokolle"

#: previews.cpp:91
msgid "Internet Protocols"
msgstr "Internet Protokolle"

#: previews.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This option makes it possible to choose when the file previews, smart folder "
"icons, and meta-data in the File Manager should be activated.\n"
"In the list of protocols that appear, select which ones are fast enough for you "
"to allow previews to be generated."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie maak dit moontlik om te kies wanneer die lêer voorskoue, luukse "
"kabinet ikone, en meta-data in die Lêer Bestuurder geaktiveer moet wees.\n"
"In die lys van protokolle wat verskyn, kies diegene wat vinnige genoeg vir jou "
"is om dit toe te laat om voorskoue te genereer."

#: previews.cpp:124
msgid "&Maximum file size:"
msgstr "Maksimum lêer grootte:"

#: previews.cpp:128
msgid " MB"
msgstr " mb"

#: previews.cpp:135
msgid "&Increase size of previews relative to icons"
msgstr "Vermeerder die grootte van voorskoue vir ikone"

#: previews.cpp:139
msgid "&Use thumbnails embedded in files"
msgstr "Gebruik duimnaelskets ingebedde in lêers"

#: previews.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Select this to use thumbnails that are found inside some file types (e.g. "
"JPEG). This will increase speed and reduce disk usage. Deselect it if you have "
"files that have been processed by programs which create inaccurate thumbnails, "
"such as ImageMagick."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie om gebruik te maak van duimnaelsketse wat gevind word in sommige lêer "
"tipes (Bv. Jpeg). Hierdie sal spoed vermeerder en disket gebruik verminder. "
"Ontkies dit as jy lêers het wat geprosesseer is deur programme wat onakurate "
"duimnaelsketse skep, soos ImageMagick."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 34
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Algemeen"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 53
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Show icons on desktop"
msgstr "Vertoon ikone op werkskerm"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 56
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ontkies hierdie opsie as jy nie ikone op die werkskerm wil hê nie. Sonder "
"ikone sal die werkskerm ietwat vinniger wees, maar jy sal nie langer in staat "
"wees om lêers na die werkskerm te trek nie."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow pro&grams in desktop window"
msgstr "Laat programme in werkskerm venster toe"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 95
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Kies hierdie opsie as jy X11 programme wil hardloop wat in die werkserm teken "
"soos xsneeu, xpikkewyn of xberg. As jy probleme het met programme soos netscape "
"wat die root venster soek om applikasies te loop, deaktiveer hierdie opsie."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 105
#: rc.cpp:18
#, , no-c-format
msgid "Show &tooltips"
msgstr "Vertoon lêer leidrade"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 113
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Bar at Top of Screen"
msgstr "Kieslys Bo-aan Skerm"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 124
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "&None"
msgstr "Geen"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 127
#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, there is no menu bar at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie gekies is, is daar geen kieslys bo-aan die skerm nie."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 135
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Desktop menu bar"
msgstr "Werkskerm Kieslys"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 138
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, there is one menu bar at the top of the screen "
"which shows the desktop menus."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie gekies is, is daar een kieslys bo-aan die skerm wat die "
"werkskerm kieslys vertoon."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 146
#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Current application's menu bar (Mac OS-style)"
msgstr "Huidige applikasie kieslys balk (Mac Os-styl)"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 149
#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, applications will not have their menu bar attached "
"to their own window anymore. Instead, there is one menu bar at the top of the "
"screen which shows the menus of the currently active application. You might "
"recognize this behavior from Mac OS."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie gekies is, sal applikasies nie meer hulle eie kieslys balk "
"binne hulle vensters hê nie. Daar sal egter 'n kieslys balk bo-aan die skerm wees "
"wat die kieslys van die aktiewe program vertoon. Jy mag hierdie dalk identifiseer as"
"gedrag van Mac OS.."

