#: rootopts.cpp:67
msgid ""
"<h1>Paths</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose where in the filesystem the files on your "
"desktop should be stored.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Paths</h1>\n"
"Hierdie module laat toe om te kies waar in die lêersisteem die lêers op jou "
"werkskerm gestoor moet word.\n"
"Gebruik die \"Wat is Hierdie?\" (Verskuiwende+F1) om hulp te verkry op spesifieke "
"opsies."

#: rootopts.cpp:74
msgid "Des&ktop path:"
msgstr "Werkskerm soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:81
msgid ""
"This folder contains all the files which you see on your desktop. You can "
"change the location of this folder if you want to, and the contents will move "
"automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie gids bevat al die lêers wat jy op jou werkskerm sien. Jy kan die ligging "
"van hierdie vouer verander as jy wil, en die inhoud sal automaties na die nuwe "
"ligging skuif."

#: rootopts.cpp:89
msgid "A&utostart path:"
msgstr "Outomatiese soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:96
msgid ""
"This folder contains applications or links to applications (shortcuts) that you "
"want to have started automatically whenever KDE starts. You can change the "
"location of this folder if you want to, and the contents will move "
"automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie gids bevat programme of skakels na programme (kortpaaie) wat jy automaties "
"wil aktiveer wanneer KDE begin. Jy kan die ligging van hierdie vouer verander as jy "
"wil, en die inhoud daarvan sal automaties na die nuwe ligging skuif."

#: rootopts.cpp:105
msgid "D&ocuments path:"
msgstr "Dokumente soeklys:"

#: rootopts.cpp:112
msgid ""
"This folder will be used by default to load or save documents from or to."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie houer sal by verstek gebruik word om dokumente vanaf te laai of na toe te stoor."

#: rootopts.cpp:195 rootopts.cpp:210
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "Outomatiese begin"

#: rootopts.cpp:199
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Werkskerm"

#: rootopts.cpp:268
msgid ""
"The path for '%1' has been changed;\n"
"do you want the files to be moved from '%2' to '%3'?"
msgstr ""
"Die soeklys vir '%1' het verander;\n"
"wil jy hê die lêers moet van '%2' na '%3' geskuif word?"

#: rootopts.cpp:269
msgid "Confirmation Required"
msgstr "Bevestiging Benodig"
